State / branch mapping (presentational dialog — the web source fetches nothing; its only data binding
is useTranslation = P1/S10; the request lifecycle is owned by the dispatcher/parent via P1/S8 source):
  loading  -> request still resolving: pinned chrome renders a spinner row (no blank box).
  empty    -> resolved with no pending request: ContentUnavailableView ("Nothing to approve").
  error    -> delivery failed: QueryError-equivalent with a Retry affordance.
  stale    -> freshness chip (amber) + cached-data banner + one guarded auto-refresh.
  offline  -> freshness chip (muted) + offline banner; cached request kept, no refetch.
  content  -> intro (mutates vs read) + tool (name + optional description) + arguments JSON + footer.
  branches reproduced + tested: mutates/read intro, description present/absent, arguments present/
  empty ({}), in-flight submitting (both buttons disabled, Approve spinner, dismissal locked).

